---
import PortfolioLayout from "../../layouts/PortfolioLayout.astro";
import { img } from "../../lib/assets.js";
---

<PortfolioLayout active="about">
  <main class="karlo-about" id="karlo-content">
    <section class="karlo-about__hero">
      <div class="karlo-about__intro">
        <h1>Hey, I’m Karlo.</h1>
        <p class="karlo-about__lead">I’m a product designer and design engineer based in Zagreb, Croatia. I run Blending Lab, my independent design practice.</p>
        <p class="karlo-about__intro-copy">My work ranges from software for an EV warranty business to websites for cities and psychology practices. Some projects I design with a team; others I design and build myself.</p>
        <a class="karlo-about__text-link" href="mailto:hello@blending-lab.com">Say hello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <figure class="karlo-about__portrait">
        <img src={img("About-me-p-1080.webp")} srcset={`${img("About-me-p-500.webp")} 500w, ${img("About-me-p-800.webp")} 800w, ${img("About-me-p-1080.webp")} 1080w`} sizes="(max-width: 620px) calc(100vw - 40px), (max-width: 900px) 36vw, 28vw" width="1080" height="1620" alt="Karlo smiling, holding his laptop" fetchpriority="high" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="karlo-about__section" aria-labelledby="karlo-background">
      <h2 id="karlo-background">How I got here</h2>
      <div class="karlo-about__copy">
        <p>I started in advertising, thinking that was my path. Over time, I moved into design, and eventually into building the frontend too.</p>
        <p>My work has covered product flows, interfaces, design systems and websites. Depending on the project, I work alongside developers or handle the frontend myself.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="karlo-about__section" aria-labelledby="karlo-work-context">
      <div class="karlo-about__section-heading">
        <h2 id="karlo-work-context">A few ways I work</h2>
        <p>The role changes with the project.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="karlo-about__work-list">
        <article class="karlo-about__work">
          <header>
            <h3><a href="/karlo/xcare">XCare <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
            <p>Embedded product designer · 2.5 years, ongoing</p>
          </header>
          <p>I designed the purchase flow, admin platform, customer portal and marketing site with a developer and a project manager. The work involved both the people buying coverage and the team handling their claims.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="karlo-about__work">
          <header>
            <h3><a href="/karlo/aspromised">AsPromised <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
            <p>Solo product · Design and frontend</p>
          </header>
          <p>I took this one from the idea to a live, paid tool. I designed the interface, built the frontend and set up the payment flow. It checks where a landing page stops delivering on the promise of its ad.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="karlo-about__work">
          <header>
            <h3><a href="/karlo/visit-sibenik">Visit Šibenik <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
            <p>Design and Webflow development · At MOA’TI</p>
          </header>
          <p>A tourism website in four languages, with connected content and a CMS for the city’s destinations, events and places to stay. I handled the design and Webflow build.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="karlo-about__cta">
      <div>
        <h2>Let’s talk.</h2>
        <p>If you’re putting a design team together, I’d be happy to hear what you’re working on.</p>
      </div>
      <a class="karlo-about__text-link" href="mailto:hello@blending-lab.com">hello@blending-lab.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </section>
  </main>
</PortfolioLayout>
